WEBVTT

00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:46.250
Things going well?

00:01:48.090 --> 00:01:49.650
Professor Itsuki!

00:01:49.650 --> 00:01:52.250
You look bored, Hanabishi-kun.

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:55.630
N-No, of course not, never bored...

00:01:55.630 --> 00:01:58.180
I haven't been getting much sleep recently.

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:02.500
Kaoru, let's play a fighting game!

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:06.270
Hanabishi-sama, would you go to a concert with me?

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:09.440
Senpai, would you please help me study for exams?

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:11.730
{Big Brother}Onii-chan, I need homework help!

00:02:19.950 --> 00:02:22.490
That's your thesis report, right?

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:29.920
If it's late, I will make you help me
writing essays in my office all summer.

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:31.830
Prepare yourself, okay?

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:33.030
Y-Yes.

00:02:33.030 --> 00:02:34.520
Okay, do your best.

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:38.560
I have high expectations of you.

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:53.620
Yes.

00:02:53.620 --> 00:02:55.450
I understood.

00:02:55.450 --> 00:02:57.440
Then please excuse me.

00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:08.220
Of course the mistress would be concerned.

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:12.200
Of course, she has approved of their relationship,

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:15.070
but thinking about Aoi-sama's happiness...

00:03:16.610 --> 00:03:21.260
What is Kaoru-dono thinking exactly?

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:22.640
About his occupation?

00:03:30.420 --> 00:03:32.900
Thank you for the food!

00:03:39.660 --> 00:03:41.360
Um, Kaoru-sama.

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:42.190
Kaoru!

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:45.370
I bought a game.

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:47.400
Look, it's "Super Underdog"!

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:48.420
Let's play!

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:50.250
Y-You see, today's not...

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:51.580
What are you saying?

00:03:51.980 --> 00:03:57.720
Today, he will be watching the movie <i>Pretty Horse</i> with me, right?

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:00.590
Underdog!

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:02.180
Pretty Horse!

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:03.550
Dog!

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:04.140
Horse!

00:04:04.350 --> 00:04:05.680
I said dog means dog!

00:04:04.350 --> 00:04:06.330
Well, today is a little...

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:07.450
I said horse means horse!

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:07.470
Well, um...

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:08.640
I'm busy.

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:09.720
Heh?!

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:15.630
Well, my thesis report has to be finished by tomorrow.

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:19.190
I haven't had much time lately, so I've only finished half.

00:04:29.850 --> 00:04:34.460
Could it be, Kaoru-sama, the reason you've looked so tired was...

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:38.660
Actually, I've been staying up
all night writing my report.

00:04:38.660 --> 00:04:41.050
Please don't overdo it.

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:44.010
Okay. But I'll be fine.

00:04:44.660 --> 00:04:45.920
Kaoru-sama.

00:04:57.340 --> 00:04:59.740
Um, Kaoru-sama?

00:04:59.740 --> 00:05:01.070
I brought tea-

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:01.460
Eh!

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:07.530
Stop it! I told you I'm the one
who'll give Kaoru a massage!

00:05:07.880 --> 00:05:10.990
If you massage his shoulders, it will only get worse!

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:14.490
H-Hold on, Tina, Mayu-chan!

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:20.880
Senpai, you'll be more focused if
you put this charm on your desk!

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:23.670
Hey, hey, {Big Brother}Onii-chan!

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:25.510
Use my erasers!

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:33.810
Everyone, what are you doing?

00:05:38.560 --> 00:05:40.770
You've saved me, Aoi-chan.

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:43.220
Are you all right, Kaoru-sama?

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:51.760
Well, it looked like we had
interfered with Kaoru's studies.

00:05:51.760 --> 00:05:57.210
We wanted him to be able to
study well today at the very least.

00:05:57.210 --> 00:05:58.710
Even so...

00:05:58.710 --> 00:05:59.830
Now, now...

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:02.900
Everyone was worried about me...

00:06:05.640 --> 00:06:06.730
Huh!

00:06:07.540 --> 00:06:09.850
Now let's go, everyone.

00:06:09.850 --> 00:06:12.280
Kaoru-sama is busy, after all.

00:06:12.280 --> 00:06:13.850
Okay!

00:06:14.250 --> 00:06:17.020
I will go and freshen up the tea.

00:06:17.620 --> 00:06:18.590
Okay.

00:06:18.590 --> 00:06:19.980
Thanks.

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:33.620
Yes?

00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:36.240
Kaoru.

00:06:36.240 --> 00:06:37.120
Tina.

00:06:38.140 --> 00:06:39.330
Can I come in?

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:40.800
S-Sure.

00:06:42.170 --> 00:06:43.850
I'm sorry about before.

00:06:43.850 --> 00:06:46.340
I made something nice to apologize.

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:46.960
Heh?!

00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:48.340
Tada!

00:06:48.790 --> 00:06:51.140
Tina's Deluxe Mixed Juice!

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:53.220
Drink this and it'll clear your head!

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:56.260
It'll speed up your report, no doubt about it!

00:06:57.090 --> 00:06:59.310
Wow, thanks, Tina.

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:05.000
The color's kind of interesting, isn't it?

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:07.000
Now drink up.

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:08.320
Okay.

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:27.960
I am not an underdog!

00:07:33.860 --> 00:07:35.390
All right!

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:37.270
I passed the first stage!

00:07:41.240 --> 00:07:42.230
Kaoru?

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:43.730
Kaoru?

00:07:44.070 --> 00:07:45.980
T-Tina.

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:47.710
This is...

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:48.530
What?

00:07:49.450 --> 00:07:51.820
T-This is...

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:53.530
What?

00:07:55.020 --> 00:07:56.490
This is...

00:08:01.360 --> 00:08:02.790
Wow!

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:09.410
Kaoru, I made a lot!

00:08:09.410 --> 00:08:10.170
Heh?!

00:08:10.530 --> 00:08:12.260
Drink some more!

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:17.390
Hanabishi-sama!

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:18.940
Are you all right?

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:25.980
If you drink any more of such suspecious stuff, you'll upset your stomach.

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:27.020
W-What's that?

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:30.320
More importantly, would you have tea with me?

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:34.750
I have my specially made
cookies and some top class tea.

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:37.740
Heh!

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:40.450
So you made these cookies?

00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:45.460
Yes, I poured my heart into
baking these cookies for you.

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:49.880
They're pretty good for cookies
you made. Like this panda.

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:51.460
It's a rabbit!

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:55.680
They burned and turned a little black, though...

00:08:55.950 --> 00:08:57.910
I thought it was a raccoon.

00:08:57.910 --> 00:08:59.760
Thank goodness I didn't say it.

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:01.720
Thanks for the food.

00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:06.190
It's bitter!

00:09:10.760 --> 00:09:12.820
Thank you, Mayu-chan.

00:09:14.100 --> 00:09:15.780
Hanabishi-sama.

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:17.950
Tina-san.

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:18.780
Mayu-san.

00:09:20.840 --> 00:09:23.870
Kaoru-sama is very busy.

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:26.170
Do you really understand this?

00:09:26.670 --> 00:09:29.670
S-Sorry.

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:21.410
I'm home.

00:11:26.880 --> 00:11:29.220
Man, I'm so tired, Aoi-cha-

00:11:29.220 --> 00:11:30.280
Welcome home.

00:11:32.720 --> 00:11:34.380
Darling.

00:11:34.830 --> 00:11:37.060
N-No way!

00:11:37.060 --> 00:11:39.100
T-This is a dream.

00:11:39.100 --> 00:11:40.040
For sure!

00:11:41.900 --> 00:11:43.930
Please tell me it's a dream!

00:11:44.550 --> 00:11:45.620
Dear.

00:11:46.310 --> 00:11:51.520
So is the report finished?

00:12:02.950 --> 00:12:05.200
I-It was a dream.

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:15.600
I fell asleep!

00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:16.870
I'm not done yet!

00:12:16.870 --> 00:12:18.620
What should I do?

00:12:26.810 --> 00:12:28.140
{Big Brother}Onii-chan!

00:12:28.140 --> 00:12:29.260
Ah!

00:12:30.020 --> 00:12:31.100
Hey!

00:12:33.320 --> 00:12:35.450
Aoi-chan. Chika-chan.

00:12:35.450 --> 00:12:37.990
We came to pick you up, {Big Brother}Onii-chan.

00:12:37.990 --> 00:12:40.320
Welcome home, Kaoru-sama.

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:41.030
I'm home.

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:44.200
Thank goodness you finished your report on time.

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:48.120
Yeah, though it felt like it was
just by the skin of my teeth.

00:12:48.120 --> 00:12:50.270
So, your summer vacation?

00:12:50.270 --> 00:12:52.500
Somehow, I managed not to lose it.

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:57.270
Then let's go home! Everyone's waiting!

00:12:57.270 --> 00:12:58.260
Yeah.

00:13:00.440 --> 00:13:01.840
We're home!

00:13:02.710 --> 00:13:04.700
Huh, you're back, back.

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:08.640
Yo!

00:13:10.950 --> 00:13:13.460
Hurry, hurry!

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:14.480
Hanabishi-sama!

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:16.530
Senpai, you're late!

00:13:19.830 --> 00:13:23.400
As I thought, they're already drunk.

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:25.400
Cheers!

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:35.410
Even so...

00:13:36.290 --> 00:13:40.090
No matter how you look at it, isn't this a bit much?

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:42.750
Don't sweat the details.

00:13:42.750 --> 00:13:48.510
And this party is a part of how we're
making up for interfering with your report.

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:50.850
So that's it.

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:51.970
Thanks.

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:57.000
More importantly, don't sit there
looking so gloomy, go and drink up!

00:13:57.000 --> 00:13:58.400
Drink up.

00:13:57.640 --> 00:13:58.400
Y-Yeah.

00:13:58.400 --> 00:13:59.980
There you go!

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:06.780
There you go!

00:14:08.250 --> 00:14:09.770
T-T-T-Tina!

00:14:23.730 --> 00:14:24.880
Hey!

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:25.630
Ah?!

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:28.100
Hanabishi-sama!

00:14:31.570 --> 00:14:35.710
Would you drink some Chateau Margaux with me?

00:14:35.710 --> 00:14:36.890
H-Hey now...

00:14:37.640 --> 00:14:40.780
We also have some delicious cheddar cheese.

00:14:40.780 --> 00:14:42.480
R-Right.

00:14:43.450 --> 00:14:44.480
Look.

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:48.490
My body has gotten this hot.

00:14:51.460 --> 00:14:53.520
Hanabishi-sama!

00:14:53.520 --> 00:14:55.490
W-Wait a second, Mayu-chan!

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:01.380
Mayu-chan, could it be...

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:06.130
Oh my!

00:15:06.130 --> 00:15:09.630
Isn't that the wine Miyabi-san was
saving for a special occasion?

00:15:09.630 --> 00:15:10.720
Eh?!

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:13.300
Ah, I think this cheese is, too.

00:15:13.300 --> 00:15:15.210
Eh! Really?

00:15:15.210 --> 00:15:16.520
This is bad.

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:19.680
But today is a special day, after all.

00:15:19.680 --> 00:15:22.560
I think that Miyabi-san would forgive us.

00:15:22.560 --> 00:15:24.860
I-I wonder.

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:29.850
Now please drink some more with me.

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:33.990
Kaoru, let's drink some more!

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:41.670
I don't know anything.

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:45.200
Sorry to all the fans.

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:51.050
We tried to measure love.

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:55.720
But it never got to you.

00:15:55.720 --> 00:16:02.120
We tried to reach up to love's height.

00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:08.980
Turn the narrowness of your shoulders into power!

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:14.110
Fight! Raging son-in-law!

00:16:18.710 --> 00:16:20.510
Kaoru!

00:16:20.510 --> 00:16:26.570
Your chest is harder and
more masculine than it looks.

00:16:30.820 --> 00:16:32.890
Everyone!

00:16:32.890 --> 00:16:35.730
Aren't you going to drink any more?

00:16:35.730 --> 00:16:38.460
We'll have beer left over.

00:17:02.950 --> 00:17:03.620
Here.

00:17:04.860 --> 00:17:06.020
Kaoru-sama.

00:17:07.020 --> 00:17:09.960
Ah! Thank you, Aoi-chan.

00:17:19.700 --> 00:17:21.890
What are you thinking about?

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:23.640
Hm? Well...

00:17:24.170 --> 00:17:28.240
I was thinking that it's already
been two years since then.

00:17:38.420 --> 00:17:41.990
Since we met again.

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:42.960
Was't it?

00:17:43.690 --> 00:17:44.540
Yeah.

00:17:45.300 --> 00:17:49.100
It kind of feels like no time has passed.

00:17:49.100 --> 00:17:50.770
Yes, it does.

00:17:50.770 --> 00:17:52.590
It feels like it was so fast.

00:17:58.550 --> 00:18:00.010
That'll do it.

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:01.560
Here, Aoi-chan.

00:18:03.410 --> 00:18:04.310
Wow!

00:18:04.310 --> 00:18:05.850
Thank you, Kaoru-sama!

00:18:16.130 --> 00:18:18.700
Um, Kaoru-sama?

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:19.700
Yes?

00:18:20.130 --> 00:18:25.630
What are you planning on doing
after you finish graduate school?

00:18:26.800 --> 00:18:28.420
Well, hm...

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:31.500
Actually, I still haven't decided.

00:18:32.180 --> 00:18:35.880
Everything just seems vague.

00:18:36.850 --> 00:18:40.040
And I'm busy with all the things I have to do.

00:18:44.090 --> 00:18:47.890
But, not what others tell me to do.

00:18:51.630 --> 00:18:53.930
With my own will,

00:18:53.930 --> 00:18:55.860
I want to decide with my own thoughts.

00:18:59.370 --> 00:19:04.160
I don't want things decided for
me by other people anymore.

00:19:05.640 --> 00:19:07.110
Kaoru-sama.

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:54.860
Well, I'll head back to my room.

00:19:54.860 --> 00:19:57.090
U-Um, Kaoru-sama.

00:19:59.300 --> 00:20:01.220
Yes, Aoi-chan?

00:20:03.670 --> 00:20:05.790
Um... I...

00:20:10.670 --> 00:20:19.230
No matter what life you choose,
I will go along with you, Kaoru-sama.

00:20:22.150 --> 00:20:23.380
That is...

00:20:24.550 --> 00:20:26.820
The life you choose, Kaoru-sama,

00:20:28.590 --> 00:20:30.930
is the life that will become mine, after all.

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:36.460
Aoi-chan!

00:22:36.180 --> 00:22:38.410
Summer Resort

00:22:36.180 --> 00:22:38.410
Yay, it's a hisho, hisho!

00:22:39.380 --> 00:22:42.970
Secretary

00:22:39.380 --> 00:22:42.970
A hisho works for a CEO or VIP.

00:22:43.880 --> 00:22:45.050
Eh, no?

00:22:45.050 --> 00:22:48.180
Um, then it means a girl like me?

00:22:49.050 --> 00:22:51.090
Beautiful Girl

00:22:49.050 --> 00:22:51.090
Oh, that's a bijyo, bijyo!

00:22:52.890 --> 00:22:55.520
Next time, the gorgeous Chika has a major part.

00:22:55.520 --> 00:22:58.000
Ai Yori Aoshi Enishi, Summer Resort.

00:22:58.000 --> 00:22:59.640
Please look forward to it!
